// BACKIN-<v>[-<mode>]-i. v = fail | undo. Ordering modes of fail (all judged by backinFailR3):
//   (none)    the Back's own sealing save is held, answered 500 at 1.5 s (later saves 500)       [the original arm]
//   fast      the same, answered 500 at once after the Back                                      [race: REPSRACE]
